# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client environment. Copy to .env.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser — that prefix is Vite's
# safety catch. NEVER put an API key, database URL or secret in this file:
# everything here is compiled into the bundle and is readable by anyone who
# opens the page. All provider keys live in server/.env, server-side only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where the API lives.
# Leave as /api in development — vite.config.ts proxies it to localhost:3001,
# which keeps requests same-origin and avoids CORS entirely.
# In production set the deployed API origin, e.g. https://legal-assist-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
